  "ruleText": "Puc 909.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement the group net metering provisions of RSA 362-A:9, XIV and commission’s expanded reporting requirement pursuant to RSA 362-F:10, IV.\n\nSource. #10502, INTERIM, eff 1-3-14, EXPIRED: 7-2-14\n\nNew. #10757, eff 1-8-15; ss by #13080, eff 9-14-20",
